# Vet45 Presentation UI

## Dual path

- **Pages/screens:** `apps/erp/lib/features/<feature>/presentation/pages/`
- **Reusable dialogs/widgets:** `modules/<module>/presentation/lib/src/widgets/`

`apps/erp` may import `vet45_<module>_presentation`. Module presentation must not import `apps/erp`.

## Hard rules

1. `*_page.dart` / `*_screen.dart` **≤ 500 lines** (`guard_presentation_size.sh`)
2. **One dialog = one file** — `StatelessWidget` in `widgets/`; no inline `AlertDialog` in pages (`guard_presentation_dialogs.sh`)
3. No large `Widget _buildXxx()` in `State` — extract class widget or separate file
4. Page = thin composition: widgets + Bloc/Cubit + `IModuleMediator` — no direct Supabase/PostgREST
5. Prefer `const` constructors when params are immutable
6. Khi dùng `vet45_async_query`, query/mutation function phải đi qua module facade (`executeQueryAsync`/`executeCommandAsync`)
7. Query key phải stable, serializable, có tenant scope cho tenant data; không dùng UUID/random làm key
8. Sau mutation, ưu tiên `invalidateQueries` thay vì gọi `load()` thủ công lặp lại
9. Không force unwrap `result.data!` trước khi đảm bảo `hasData` (tránh null ở pending+idle)
10. Tránh duplicate state machine: đã dùng `UseQuery` thì không tạo thêm loading/error machine trùng lặp trong widget tree

## Golden reference

- `apps/erp/lib/features/dashboard/presentation/dashboard_page.dart`
- `apps/erp/lib/features/dashboard/presentation/widgets/dashboard_header.dart`

## Design System (Polaris)

- Spec: `packages/vet45_design_system/docs/polaris/06-design-system-spec.md`
- Checklist PR: `packages/vet45_design_system/docs/polaris/07-token-migration-checklist.md`
- Ưu tiên layout patterns (`VPageScaffold`, `VGap`, `VPagePadding`, `VSection`) trước khi invent widget mới
- Không magic spacing (`EdgeInsets` literal) — dùng `VSpacing` / layout primitives
- Typography qua `VText`; overlay qua `showVConfirmDialog` / `showVBottomSheet`

## Before implementing UI slice

1. Read `.cursor/skills/presentation-layer/SKILL.md`
2. Read Polaris spec + checklist (links above)
3. Read UI artifacts in FR/US spec — create widget manifest first
4. Implement widgets/dialogs before the page
5. Nếu tích hợp async query, đọc `packages/vet45_async_query/docs/AGENT_INTEGRATION_PLAYBOOK.md`
6. Verify: `./scripts/ci/verify_harness.sh` + `./scripts/ci/guard_design_system_usage.sh`
